{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38203","headline":"访明公大德 · 韩偓","name":"访明公大德","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寸发如霜袒右肩，倚肩筇竹貌怡然。\n悬灯深屋夜分坐，移榻向阳斋後眠。\n刮膜且扬三毒论，摄心徐指二宗禅。\n清凉药分能知味，各自胷中有醴泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}